`},Ur={name:"Trail Base \u2014 Road to 15km",fm:{parallel:!0,ladder:[4,5,6,5,7,8,9,6,10,11.5,13,15],start_date:""},body:["Rebuilding to a comfortable 15km on trail. An easy 30-minute run on","Tuesday and the long trail run on Saturday. Want a second easy run?","Friday is the place for it \u2014 never the day after legs.","","The long-run ladder steps DOWN in weeks 4 and 8 on purpose \u2014 that is","where the adaptation lands. Coming back from illness, walk-run the first","week or two rather than forcing it, and repeat a week whenever it felt","hard. The ladder is a guide, not a contract.","","## Easy Run (tue)","","30 minutes conversational. Treadmill or road \u2014 whatever gets it done.","","- Easy Run | 1 x 30 min easy","","## Long Trail Run (sat)","","Mountain or forest. Slow, and walk the climbs.","","- Long Trail Run | 1 x per the ladder"].join(`
